<v Teacher 1>So class, we've got a new sixth grader who has just moved to town. So, John, why don't you tell the class a little bit about yourself?
<v Teacher 1>所以同学们，我们有个新来的六年级学生刚搬到镇上。那么，约翰，为什么不向班级介绍一下你自己呢？

