<v John>I'm a full-grown man.
<v John>我是个成年男人。

00:28:44.280 --> 00:28:52.780
<v Teacher 1>All right. Well, Terry, you were in the middle of your talk about what you did this summer.
<v Teacher 1>好吧。那么，泰瑞（Terry），你刚才在讲你暑假做了什么，请继续。

00:28:52.780 --> 00:29:19.000
<v Terry>Yes, this summer I went on a cruise to the Bahamas-- me, my mom, my dad, my younger brother Jason. We got on the cruise. And there was 100 bedrooms. 100 bedrooms. And in the morning, you get up and everybody has breakfast together. And sometimes there's different entertainers in the middle of the day. If you don't want to go to the entertainer, you can go swim or you can go lay on the deck.
<v Terry>是的，今年夏天我去了巴哈马群岛游轮——我和我妈妈、爸爸，还有我弟弟杰森（Jason）。我们上了游轮。有100间卧室。100间卧室。早上起来大家一起吃早餐。中午有时会有不同的艺人。如果你不想看艺人，你可以去游泳或躺在甲板上。

00:29:19.000 --> 00:29:40.970
<v Terry>And once we port-- that's what they call it when the boat stops in the city-- once you port, you and your family get together. Make sure you have your passport. Because if you don't, they might not let you back on the boat, no matter what. We do all this. Then we, uh-- oo, one time, my brother stepped on a jellyfish.
<v Terry>一旦我们靠港——那是当船停在城市时的叫法——一旦靠港，你和你的家人就聚在一起。确保你有护照。因为如果没有，他们可能就不会让你回船上了，不管怎样都不行。我们做了这一切。然后我们，呃——哦，有一次，我弟弟踩到了一只水母。

00:29:40.970 --> 00:29:47.270
<v John>I have a story. I'm the biggest pop star in all the world.
<v John>我有个故事。我是全世界最大的流行歌星。

