<v Teacher 1>John, just one second, please. Terry is telling a very interesting story.
<v Teacher 1>约翰，等一秒钟，好吗。泰瑞正在讲一个非常有意思的故事。

00:29:54.530 --> 00:29:57.940
<v John>I made the biggest hits in all of America and also in Britain.
<v John>我创造了全美乃至英国最大的金曲。

